Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.44,0:00:02.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,光明与黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.54,0:00:04.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在陷入一片混乱的战国时代
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.38,0:00:06.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了四魂之玉因缘际会聚在一起的伙伴们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.74,0:00:08.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿越五百年的时光
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.31,0:00:11.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在最后仅存的四魂之玉碎片引导着各自的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.62,0:00:13.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,战国时代的传奇故事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.02,0:00:14.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.42,0:00:17.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,受到那群妖鸟袭击的城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.19,0:00:19.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落究竟在那里隐藏了什么样惊人的秘密呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.92,0:00:22.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且 在守卫城堡的人群中
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.29,0:00:24.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然出现了珊瑚的弟弟琥珀的身影
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:29.29,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You can now dream （勇敢的梦想） 挥起舞动{\fad(300,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.43,0:00:36.16,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm in a world （暧昧的世界） 奋力冲出吧{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.88,0:00:49.41,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,面对忧郁的现实生活{\fad(0,100)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.86,0:00:55.59,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不断在心中自我成长的勇者
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.76,0:01:01.82,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨夜的梦境及梦中残留的影像{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.90,0:01:06.80,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,断断续续提醒我「勇往直前」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.04,0:01:14.64,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,破茧而出的我及含苞待放的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.81,0:01:19.41,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你就将它禁锢起来吗{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.85,0:01:23.78,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You can now dream （勇敢的梦想） 挥起舞动
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.92,0:01:28.29,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Go and try （不顾一切的去尝试） 无尽的烦恼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.43,0:01:32.76,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与你天长地久永不分离
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.90,0:01:35.73,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Do you need to cry （同样的哭泣） 和孤独相伴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.87,0:01:40.26,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Show me a day fight （直接应战） 每当伤心流泪的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.40,0:01:47.37,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让它成为坚定不移的梦想吧{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.76,0:02:12.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要杀了奈落？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.70,0:02:14.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 母亲大人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.44,0:02:16.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自从跟那个家伙有所瓜葛之后就没有什么好事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.44,0:02:19.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老是出现一些碍手碍脚的麻烦事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.27,0:02:22.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就连帮母亲大人冲淡身上毒素的人血
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.04,0:02:24.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也反而变得越来越难收集了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.25,0:02:29.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最不能原谅的是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.18,0:02:31.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然让我阿毘公主
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.79,0:02:34.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卷入了他们半妖之间无聊的争斗之中
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.86,0:02:35.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.39,0:02:39.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么你不如试着去攻打那个城堡看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.39,0:02:41.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.80,0:02:44.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一个非常可疑的城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.47,0:02:48.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕跟奈落有着很深的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.07,0:02:50.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,母亲大人 那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.51,0:02:54.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚好跟那个圣大人差不多时候出现的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.24,0:02:56.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是那个家伙吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.25,0:02:59.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.86,0:03:09.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖鸟烧起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.50,0:03:24.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,圣大人终于回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.14,0:03:26.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救…救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.81,0:03:30.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是布下结界的那个家伙吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.78,0:03:32.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.93,0:03:50.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得…得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.03,0:03:52.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的鸟全都消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.13,0:03:54.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 这到底是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.00,0:03:58.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自从遇上奈落之后就一直遇到碍事的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.04,0:04:07.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么看来那个圣大人好像是奈落的眼中钉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.08,0:04:12.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落释放出手下的妖怪布满了整个天空
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.49,0:04:14.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到处寻找那个圣大人的藏身之地
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.76,0:04:20.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经派出鸟儿去调查这样的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.76,0:04:23.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果发现只有一个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.70,0:04:26.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些妖怪完全没有接近
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.97,0:04:28.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是一个人类的城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.07,0:04:34.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的妖怪就像没有看见城堡一样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.41,0:04:35.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从上空飞了过去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.71,0:04:39.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定是因为这个地方跟奈落有着关系
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.48,0:04:41.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以才没有必要去搜查
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.22,0:04:45.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你试着去袭击那个城堡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.92,0:04:48.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看奈落到底在那个地方隐藏了什么秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.16,0:04:53.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第152话 保护并且夺取
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.67,0:04:59.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.50,0:05:03.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您看看少爷睡得很甜呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.51,0:05:05.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.94,0:05:07.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚上也从来不哭闹
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.74,0:05:10.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是一个乖孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.38,0:05:14.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仿佛那天晚上可怕的事件从来没有发生过
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.18,0:05:18.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在我生下这个孩子的那天晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.82,0:05:22.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当时在产房里帮忙的所有人全部都死了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.32,0:05:24.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.13,0:05:27.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像有某个人出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.13,0:05:34.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在却想不起来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.27,0:05:42.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后那个晚上的记忆就越来越淡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.21,0:05:48.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 不能去那里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.35,0:05:53.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可以进来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.65,0:05:54.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.62,0:05:56.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.42,0:05:58.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实在是非常的抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.43,0:06:03.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这孩子是刚来我们这不久的下人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.43,0:06:05.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没有习惯这个地方的环境
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.80,0:06:07.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.30,0:06:09.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫他抬起头让我看看他的脸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.80,0:06:10.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.57,0:06:12.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抬起头来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.37,0:06:14.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.15,0:06:22.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是不是在哪里见过面
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.18,0:06:24.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.45,0:06:27.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个孩子怎么可能有机会见过夫人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.59,0:06:29.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.39,0:06:30.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.52,0:06:31.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.96,0:06:33.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来是我多心了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.40,0:06:37.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.66,0:06:38.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.42,0:07:03.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夫人看起来好像是一位很温柔的人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.29,0:07:04.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.36,0:07:06.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且夫人最近刚生了嗣子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.86,0:07:08.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.50,0:07:14.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.74,0:07:18.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和神无一起留在那个城堡里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.01,0:07:19.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,遵命
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.87,0:07:22.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在城堡里面生活 保护好那个婴儿
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.38,0:07:28.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 要多吃一点
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.58,0:07:29.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.41,0:08:01.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把这些柴搬走了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.92,0:08:03.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.05,0:08:05.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系 没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.19,0:08:10.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个城堡好平静
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.49,0:08:13.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很久以前
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.93,0:08:17.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好像也曾经像这样跟很多人生活在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.93,0:08:22.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我已经想不起来那是什么时候的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.38,0:08:39.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 一群吸人血的鸟群
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.19,0:08:40.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您知道这件事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.12,0:08:43.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近好像都在传这件事情
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.69,0:08:45.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们当然也有听说过这个传闻
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.99,0:08:47.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么这附近有吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.69,0:08:49.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从来都没有看过
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.63,0:08:52.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且这里就在城堡的山脚下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.67,0:08:56.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪们肯定是不能靠近这里的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.41,0:09:05.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里也不是我们要找的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.58,0:09:07.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.21,0:09:09.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又没有妖鸟巢穴的线索
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.65,0:09:13.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来我们今天只好先在这里借宿一晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.72,0:09:15.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说只好借宿一晚是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.19,0:09:16.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要去哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.06,0:09:20.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帅哥
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.29,0:09:21.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我们一起玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.03,0:09:24.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也好想玩呀… 但还是算了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.57,0:09:29.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.10,0:09:30.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,受不够教训
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.81,0:09:37.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,白童子这个小鬼没有心脏
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.58,0:09:40.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以不管被怎么四分五裂都不会死
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.06,0:09:50.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙的心脏到底在哪里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.13,0:09:54.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐 你在想什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.33,0:09:56.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少啰唆
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.73,0:09:58.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你总得让我有想的自由吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.14,0:10:04.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.74,0:10:05.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.64,0:10:09.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是那个叫什么鸟之使者阿毘公主吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.75,0:10:13.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐 跟在她们后面
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.08,0:10:16.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要监视着就好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.98,0:10:18.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不准你多管闲事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.79,0:10:21.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多管闲事是什么意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.36,0:10:23.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.23,0:10:36.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是奈落的毒虫吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.14,0:10:37.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来监视我的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.31,0:10:45.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走着瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.49,0:10:59.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个女妖怪… 变成奈落的敌人了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.40,0:11:12.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.54,0:11:15.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.81,0:11:17.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听到你在呻吟
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.68,0:11:18.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要紧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.05,0:11:20.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是做恶梦了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.42,0:11:24.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是什么样的梦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.69,0:11:29.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想不起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.52,0:11:31.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.29,0:11:33.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.53,0:11:39.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉好点了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.57,0:11:41.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.87,0:11:45.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来要做个好梦喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.81,0:11:57.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙一开始打呼 其他人就没办法好好睡了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.72,0:12:06.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都好亲切
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.60,0:12:16.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么 不感谢我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.77,0:12:17.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.84,0:12:21.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我奈落把你弟弟的命捡回来的喔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.91,0:12:27.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.58,0:12:29.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要保护奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.65,0:12:31.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我让他忘记了全部的事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.75,0:12:34.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关于你的事 还有琥珀所有的记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.59,0:12:37.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.26,0:12:40.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在在做什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.77,0:12:47.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,洗得好舒服喔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.63,0:12:49.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚你也去洗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.94,0:12:58.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是阿毘公主的妖鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.41,0:12:59.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝城堡的方向去了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.28,0:13:05.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀你连父母的样子都不记得了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.05,0:13:08.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,战争中失去父母的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.89,0:13:09.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.26,0:13:12.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.83,0:13:17.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是还好你来到这城堡和大家在一块
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.63,0:13:22.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这里工作的每一个人就像是一家人感情很好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.58,0:13:32.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.92,0:13:43.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是妖鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.96,0:13:45.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,危险啊 快躲起来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.00,0:13:53.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好…好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.97,0:13:56.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥…琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.44,0:13:58.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对不能出去外面 知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.21,0:14:01.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.45,0:14:13.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 去保护那个婴儿
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.99,0:14:22.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.50,0:14:24.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会有事的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.13,0:14:26.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有这个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.00,0:14:29.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,城堡里所有的人都会保护我们的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.24,0:14:31.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算是牺牲自己的生命
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.01,0:14:35.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些妖鸟出动了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.01,0:14:37.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们正在袭击城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.65,0:14:39.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有四魂之玉碎片的气息
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.01,0:14:40.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.38,0:14:42.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且那个是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.75,0:14:43.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀身上的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.92,0:14:45.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀在城堡里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.25,0:14:46.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个气息一定是他没错
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.52,0:14:50.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 你又受到了奈落的命令吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.52,0:14:52.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次你又打算做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.04,0:15:06.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 去保护那个婴儿
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.64,0:15:08.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保护嗣子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.91,0:15:09.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别让它们靠近屋内
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.15,0:15:16.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道这些妖鸟是因为知道婴儿在这里而来的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.59,0:15:25.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在这个地方干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.93,0:15:27.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只是个下人的小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.76,0:15:29.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点找个地方躲起来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.46,0:15:30.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.70,0:15:33.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们保护了我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.90,0:15:38.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.81,0:15:41.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到了城堡之后就直接去找琥珀吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.71,0:15:44.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖鸟让我来对付
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.09,0:15:53.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快去啊 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.32,0:15:54.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.22,0:15:54.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.09,0:15:56.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉碎片的气息在那个方向
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.59,0:15:58.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.56,0:16:01.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.10,0:16:05.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.97,0:16:13.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 又是你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.64,0:16:16.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿毘公主 你还没受够教训啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.11,0:16:18.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.14,0:16:20.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是奈落的敌人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.58,0:16:23.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你为什么要保护这个城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.32,0:16:24.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.62,0:16:25.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个城堡…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.09,0:16:28.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难不成这里跟奈落有什么关系吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.26,0:16:31.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我要来证明的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.62,0:16:35.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然现在出来抵抗的就只有人类
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.03,0:16:37.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.76,0:16:40.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是已经跟奈落联手了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.83,0:16:42.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.27,0:16:44.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是那家伙一厢情愿而已
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.64,0:16:46.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说你跟奈落已经闹翻啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.87,0:16:49.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你就不要再插手多管闲事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.68,0:16:51.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落那个家伙由我们来打倒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.61,0:16:53.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我先来解决你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.98,0:16:56.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我滚回去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.19,0:17:02.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来跟奈落扯上关系唯一的好处
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.42,0:17:04.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概就是这把三叉戟的结界吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.93,0:17:07.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.06,0:17:10.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瘴气
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.46,0:17:12.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.63,0:17:15.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有这个作用啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.77,0:17:16.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接招
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.47,0:17:18.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少得意了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.08,0:17:27.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让阿毘公主跟犬夜叉两个人互相厮杀
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.58,0:17:29.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,似乎不是奈落计划的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.82,0:17:32.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个城堡里到底有什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.26,0:17:45.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖鸟烧起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.07,0:17:55.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.31,0:17:56.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,着火了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.18,0:17:57.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么办呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.38,0:18:06.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夫人 您快点到外头去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.39,0:18:08.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再待在这里的话会被烧死的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.59,0:18:11.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是那个叫琥珀的孩子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.39,0:18:13.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.79,0:18:16.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是外头有妖怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.43,0:18:17.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一点都没错
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.93,0:18:20.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎么样我都必须保护这个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.83,0:18:22.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他是很重要的嗣子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.80,0:18:23.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.07,0:18:26.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会用自己的生命来保护他的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.77,0:18:27.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点 往这边
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.01,0:18:29.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.39,0:18:45.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好难受
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.39,0:18:46.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,振作一点
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.14,0:19:02.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.18,0:19:03.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.94,0:19:04.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都没事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.65,0:19:07.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.68,0:19:10.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这孩子救了我们
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.58,0:19:12.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.62,0:19:15.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 我要谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.56,0:19:18.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.73,0:19:21.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必须让夫人他们到安全一点的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.16,0:19:23.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 你就待在夫人的身边
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.06,0:19:24.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.60,0:19:25.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖鸟又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.21,0:19:35.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你帮了我大忙 琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.18,0:19:37.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,往那边了 大家快点
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.88,0:19:41.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我问你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.92,0:19:44.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是在哪里学会这些本领的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.45,0:19:46.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是看着别人模仿的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.42,0:19:47.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来好像是驱魔师
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.19,0:19:50.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又来了 大家
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.52,0:19:51.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托掩护一下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.66,0:19:52.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.49,0:19:55.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,驱魔师
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.23,0:19:59.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.53,0:20:03.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.21,0:20:10.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.21,0:20:12.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以前好像也像这样战斗过
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.91,0:20:15.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟伙伴们一起同心协力
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.92,0:20:18.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.79,0:20:19.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.72,0:20:20.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.51,0:20:41.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,殿下…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.67,0:20:43.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,殿下受到妖鸟的攻击了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.44,0:20:45.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,城堡…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.15,0:20:47.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被攻陷了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.82,0:20:57.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.66,0:21:00.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.09,0:21:02.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要紧的 夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.66,0:21:07.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 把婴儿抢过来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.77,0:21:10.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把周遭的人通通杀掉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.87,0:21:13.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀掉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.48,0:21:17.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.18,0:21:22.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.28,0:21:25.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一定…一定会得救的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.46,0:21:34.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 你在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.34,0:21:46.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干得好 琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.07,0:21:48.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就靠你了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.08,0:21:50.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.58,0:21:55.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀掉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.15,0:21:58.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把周遭的人通通杀掉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.32,0:22:02.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀掉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.36,0:22:14.23,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Brand-New World 全新梦想的起点{\fad(0,200)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.33,0:22:21.21,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝向目标持续旅程 直到最后{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.34,0:22:29.51,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Brand-New Mind 怀抱热情直到下一扇门扉{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.62,0:22:35.82,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冲向未知的世界 快奔驰吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.26,0:22:44.75,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伸手触摸 那微尘般的希望之星{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.86,0:22:53.57,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使勉强握住 横冲直撞的我们想往何处?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.67,0:22:59.77,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保有自我 Let's go and Try 前进吧 使命只有One way{\fad(0,25)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.65,0:23:06.81,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺其自然 Do it! Ready? 最后愿望将达成{\fad(50,200)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.92,0:23:13.79,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Brand-New World 全新梦想的起点
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.89,0:23:20.80,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝向目标持续旅程 直到最后
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.90,0:23:28.97,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Brand-New Mind 怀抱热情直到下一扇门扉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.14,0:23:35.38,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冲向未知的世界 快奔驰吧{\fad(0,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.47,0:23:52.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我到底是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.97,0:23:55.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丧失了记忆 受到奈落控制的琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.14,0:23:57.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个人是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.48,0:24:00.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然再次相遇却还是想不起姐姐珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.25,0:24:02.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你又做出这种事了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.68,0:24:03.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又做了…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.78,0:24:05.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在阿毘公主与犬夜叉对决的同时
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.15,0:24:09.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,背负着悲伤过去的姐姐跟弟弟也陷入了激战
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.16,0:24:11.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.52,0:24:13.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,命中注定的残酷重逢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.76,0:24:15.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算死了也没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.29,0:24:16.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那怕要跟他同归于尽
